<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span><h2>Through our five-step process</h2><p>Every campaign follows the same five-step process — Discover, Plan, Build, Launch, Grow — so the creative, the media and the measurement all serve the same objective.</p></div>
<div class="values">
<article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>We learn about your business, your market and your past campaigns, and agree the goal for this one.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Plan</h3><p>Audiences, channels, budget and creative direction are agreed before anything goes live.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Ads, landing pages and creative are produced and reviewed, with <a href="/expertise-seo/">SEO</a> and <a href="/social-media-marketing/">social media</a> in the mix where they help.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Launch</h3><p>Campaigns go live with tracking in place, so every click and enquiry can be traced back to its source.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>05</span><h3>Grow</h3><p>We review results, shift budget to what works, and keep improving — campaign after campaign.</p></article>
</div></section>
